{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"NUM","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"民數記","commonName":"民數記","title":"民數記","order":4,"numberOfChapters":36,"sha256":"7c111f07a9bd9423759abb7c8e169e1e99ed2bf1c6e109dc17b097e7eec739cf","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/NUM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":36,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/NUM/36.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1272},"chapter":{"number":34,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["迦南地的境界"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華曉諭摩西說："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「你吩咐以色列人說：你們到了迦南地，就是歸你們為業的迦南四境之地，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["南角要從尋的曠野，貼着以東的邊界；南界要從鹽海東頭起，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["繞到亞克拉濱坡的南邊，接連到尋，直通到加低斯‧巴尼亞的南邊，又通到哈薩‧亞達，接連到押們，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["從押們轉到埃及小河，直通到海為止。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["「西邊要以大海為界；這就是你們的西界。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["「北界要從大海起，劃到何珥山，"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["從何珥山劃到哈馬口，通到西達達，"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["又通到西斐崙，直到哈薩‧以難。這要作你們的北界。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["「你們要從哈薩‧以難劃到示番為東界。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["這界要從示番下到亞延東邊的利比拉，又要達到基尼烈湖的東邊。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["這界要下到約旦河，通到鹽海為止。這四圍的邊界以內，要作你們的地。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["摩西吩咐以色列人說：「這地就是耶和華吩咐拈鬮給九個半支派承受為業的；"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["因為呂便支派和迦得支派按着宗族受了產業，瑪拿西半個支派也受了產業。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["這兩個半支派已經在耶利哥對面、約旦河東、向日出之地受了產業。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["各支派首領負責分地"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["耶和華曉諭摩西說："]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["「要給你們分地為業之人的名字是祭司以利亞撒和嫩的兒子約書亞。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["又要從每支派中選一個首領幫助他們。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["這些人的名字：猶大支派有耶孚尼的兒子迦勒。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["西緬支派有亞米忽的兒子示母利。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["便雅憫支派有基斯倫的兒子以利達。"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["但支派有一個首領，約利的兒子布基。"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["約瑟的子孫瑪拿西支派有一個首領，以弗的兒子漢聶。"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["以法蓮支派有一個首領，拾弗但的兒子基母利。"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["西布倫支派有一個首領，帕納的兒子以利撒番。"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["以薩迦支派有一個首領，阿散的兒子帕鐵。"]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":["亞設支派有一個首領，示羅米的兒子亞希忽。"]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":["拿弗他利支派有一個首領，亞米忽的兒子比大黑。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":["這些人就是耶和華所吩咐、在迦南地把產業分給以色列人的。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/NUM/34.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/NUM/35.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/NUM/33.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":29}